<title>USA: ConAgra Inc sells $300 mln bonds.</title>
<headline>ConAgra Inc sells $300 mln bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from ConAgra Inc priced Tuesday, according to lead manager Smith Barney.</p>
<p>ConAgra Inc is a diversified food company.</p>
<p>BORROWER CONAGRA INC</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.70 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2027</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD  6.70 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD +60 BPS    PUTABLE IN THE 12TH YEAR</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
